Delay 25 ms
MoveR 2 0
Delay 25 ms
MoveR 3 2
Delay 25 ms
MoveR 3 2
Delay 25 ms
MoveR 2 2
Delay 25 ms
MoveR 0 2
Delay 25 ms
MoveR -2 2
Delay 25 ms
MoveR -3 2
Delay 25 ms
MoveR -3 2
Delay 25 ms
MoveR -3 2
Delay 25 ms
MoveR 2 0
Delay 25 ms
MoveR 2 2
Delay 25 ms
MoveR 2 2
Delay 25 ms
LeftUp 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Rust</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>